 their 3rd baseman, " [:a {:href "/athletes/1501"} "Omar Linares"] ", and outfielder, " [:a {:href "/athletes/1499"} "Orestes Kindelán"] ".  The silver medalists, Chinese Taipei, included 11 players who had previously played on championship teams at the Little League World Series.  The United States, the home of baseball, failed to win a medal, although the USA team included several future Major League stars, notably " [:a {:href "/athletes/3225"} "Nomar Garciaparra"] ", " [:a {:href "/athletes/3226"} "Jason Giambi"] ", and " [:a {:href "/athletes/3252"} "Jason Varitek"] "."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button836324", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button836324').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Wins/At Bats"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Losses/Runs"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points/Hits"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Runs For/Doubles"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Runs Against/Triples"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Home Runs"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "RBIs"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Walks"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Strikeouts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Stolen Bases/Caught Stealing"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Sacrifice Hits/Sacrifice Flies"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Batting Average"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Won/Lost/Saves"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Innings Pitched"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Hits Allowed"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Runs Allowed"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Earned Runs Allowed"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Home Runs Allowed"] [:th 